{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27388","headline":"题平陆县亭 · 顾非熊","name":"题平陆县亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤亭临峭岸，别有远泉来。\n山与中条合，河逢一曲廻。\n夜声多鴈过，晚色乱云开。\n却自求僮仆，淹留莫谩催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}